    "UIName": "Exterminator IIC",
    "Id": "chassisdef_exterminator_iic_EXT-IIC-Z",
    "Name": "Exterminator IIC",
    "Details": "The Exterminator IIC-Z represents the Society's attempt to breathe new life into a design long regarded as dezgra by Clan warriors. Where the Clans shunned the Exterminator's origins as a hunter of command units, Society engineers saw a BattleMech purpose-built for eliminating high-value targets. Extensive stealth systems and an IFF jammer allow the IIC-Z to close with its prey, while all ammunition-dependent weaponry has been eliminated to permit extended operations behind enemy lines. Four Medium Supra Lasers provide devastating close-range firepower, with variable firing modes allowing the pilot to adapt as engagement ranges change. Twin Micro Pulse Laser Arrays excel at exploiting damaged armor while remaining lethal against infantry and battle armor, while a pair of Laser AMS provides ammunition-independent protection from incoming missiles. The result is an Exterminator returned to its original purpose: infiltrate, identify, and destroy the enemy's most valuable asset before disappearing back into the confusion.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_exterminatoriic"
